### 1. Root route
GET http://localhost:3000/

### 2. About route (Student Info)
GET http://localhost:3000/about

### 3. GET all books (Read All)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/

### 4. GET single book by ID (Read One)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/1/

### 5. POST add a new book (Create)
POST http://localhost:3000/books/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Eloquent JavaScript",
  "author": "Marijn Haverbeke",
  "price": 550,
  "pages": 472
}

### 6. PUT update existing book (Update)
PUT http://localhost:3000/books/1/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Code: A Handbook of Agile Software Craftsmanship",
  "author": "Robert C. Martin",
  "price": 699,
  "pages": 464
}

### 7. DELETE book by ID (Delete)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/books/11/

### 8. GET non-existent book (404 Error Handling)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/999/

